<section>
<title>Detailed Description</title>

<para>Defines some useful byte order swap routines.</para>

<para>This is required to read big-endian model formats on little-endian machines, and vice versa. Direct use of this class is DEPRECATED. Use #StreamReader instead. </para>
</section>
